    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾰλᾰμήδης</span></b> , ὁ, voc.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Ra.</u>
			1451
		</span></i>; gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ους</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Or.</u>
			433
		</span></i>, etc.; dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ει</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Ap.</u>
			41b
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εϊ</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Q.S.
			5.198
		</span></i>; acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Ep.</u>
			311b
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εα</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>IA</u>
			198
		</span></i> (lyr.); but some forms occur of <i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i> decl., dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῃ</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκεστρον</span>
			; acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ην</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				261d
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλάμη</span>):—<u>Palamedes</u>, i.e.
				<i>the Inventor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				770
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1451
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.20.3
			</span></i>:—hence Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾰλᾰμήδειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<i>worthy of Palamedes, ingenious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούλευμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβάκιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					666.21
				</span></i>
			; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾰλᾰμηδικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, Π. τοὐξεύρημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					351.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
